n without pause,","with deep, vast and lofty","meanings,","in an endless evocation of meaning.","Always,","with so many possibilities like these,","it seemed so astonishing,","that gentle smile.","From its beginning to its edge,","the more it was interpreted,","the more horizon-wide meanings","appeared in so many colours,","so many scents, so many thoughts.","Many questions","weighed down and stirred the mind,","to pierce this storehouse of mystery.","Exhausted moments","sought themselves in withered flowers,","in retreating ocean waves,","in the wings of a flying dove,","in the sprawling afternoon shadow."],["And yet,","so great an identity of one's own","time rejected again and again.","So much pride, so much capability,","clearly and plainly,","lay with its neck twisted,","like modern, incomprehensible painting."],["Just then,","from within oneself, unseen, slowly,","the dark serpent that reveals itself","keeps biting without pause,","amid all the deceit and discord","preserved until today,","the pretence of one's worn-out manhood."],["Is this gentle smile not","the irony of a life lost!","Is it not all the failures!","The search has not ended yet","for the beginning of an endless circle;","the search has not ended","for a little truth among countless errors.","Even amid so much despondency,","it looks just like a dream,","that gentle smile,","new, only new."]],"inline_breaks":[],"hidden_lines":[]},"hi":{"label":"हिन्दी","title":"मंद मुस्कान","kind":"Translation","stanzas":[["कब से ऐसी हँसी","किसी ने नहीं देखी।","उसमें कोई रहस्य नहीं था,","कोई छल नहीं, यहाँ तक कि","उपहास भी नहीं।","फिर भी,","होंठों पर वैसे ही ठहरी थी","एक सादी मंद मुस्कान।"],["नदी के इस पार से उस पार,","पुल की तरह जोड़ती थी","यह मुस्कान","भाव को भाव से।","छाया-प्रकाश का एक खेल,","जैसे निरंतर चल रहा हो,","गहरे, विशाल और ऊँचे","अर्थों के साथ,","अंतहीन अर्थ-व्यंजना में।","हर समय,","ऐसी अनेक संभावनाएँ लिए,","बहुत विस्मयकारी लगती थी","मंद मुस्कान।","उसके आदि से अंत तक","जितनी व्याख्याएँ होतीं,","उतने 